WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.380
and the warrior whispers back, I am the storm.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.400
Erika is the storm.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.080
We are the storm.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.760
And our enemies cannot comprehend our strength,

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.879
our determination, our resolve, our passion.

